{'symbol': 'APTV', 'date': '2019-11-06 14:30:00', 'title': 'Aptiv Sees 2019 Global Vehicle Production To End Down 5%', 'text': 'APTIV PLC CEO KEVIN CLARK SAYS TRADE CONFLICTS HAVE HAD SOME IMPACT ON BUSINESS- BAIRD 2019 INDUSTRIAL CONFERENCE.APTIV PLC SAYS A YEAR AGO CO ESTIMATED OVERALL COSTS TO ABOUT $75 MILLION WHICH HAS BEEN BEEN CUT BY ROUGHLY HALF.APTIV PLC SAYS 2019 GLOBAL VEHICLE PRODUCTION WILL END DOWN 5%; SAYS 2020 VEHICLE PRODUCTION WOULD LIKELY BE DOWN ROUGHLY 3%.APTIV PLC SAYS DID ABOUT $900 MILLION OF ACTIVE SAFETY REVENUES LAST YEAR; EXPECTS 25% COMPOUNDED GROWTH RATE NEXT SEVERAL YEARS.APTIV PLC SAYS $14.3 BILLION REVENUES EXPECTATION THIS YEAR INCLUDES THE IMPACT OF GM STRIKE.'}
{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2019-11-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'Arthur J. Gallagher & Co. (NYSE:AJG) acquired BonusDrive.', 'text': "Arthur J. Gallagher & Co. (NYSE:AJG) acquired BonusDrive on November 6, 2019. Jim Evans, Tim Easterwood and their associates will continue to operate from their current locations under the direction of John Neumaier, head of Gallagher's Northeast region employee benefits consulting and brokerage operations.\nArthur J. Gallagher & Co. (NYSE:AJG) completed the acquisition of BonusDrive on November 6, 2019.\n"}
